        <item>
            <title>0.1.12</title>
            <description sparkle:format="html"><![CDATA[
                <h3>What's new in 0.1.12</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Added separate attention markers for the weekly and 5-hour quota windows.</li>
                    <li>Refreshes live subscription quota data periodically and when the menu-bar popover opens.</li>
                    <li>Fixed update checks from Settings so finding no update does not reopen the dashboard.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
