        <item>
            <title>0.1.11</title>
            <description sparkle:format="html"><![CDATA[
                <h3>What's new in 0.1.11</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Fixed startup Dock behavior so the persistent companion process no longer briefly appears and disappears; the dashboard process owns the visible Dock icon.</li>
                    <li>Clarified the companion and dashboard application labels as CodexDashboard Companion and CodexDashboard.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
