        <item>
            <title>0.1.10</title>
            <description sparkle:format="html"><![CDATA[
                <h3>What's new in 0.1.10</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Renamed the dashboard application menu to <code>CodexDashboard</code>.</li>
                    <li>Kept the embedded dashboard helper bundle and lifecycle unchanged.</li>
                </ul>
                <h3>Included from v0.1.9</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Improved update and window activation so Sparkle prompts and dashboard windows open in the expected app context.</li>
                    <li>Made very small monthly usage shares remain visible in the menu-bar summary.</li>
                    <li>Refined helper-window behavior and the Window menu.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
